# Security

Forbidden:

- broker credential storage
- cookie extraction
- Authorization header interception
- live order click / submit automation
- exposing Supabase `service_role` or secrets in the browser/extension

If a change introduces these, stop and fail tests. Prefer IndexedDB local-first;
Supabase remains future optional sync only.
